{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前リハーサル終わって、まあやさゆりんななみひなちゃんろってぃとあだ名について話してたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔何て呼ばれてた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って聞かれて「しぃちゃん」って言ったらみんなに \"あ〜、しぃちゃんっぽーい！\" って声を揃えて言われました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もななみんに言われた(〃▽〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他は、まいぴょことかいーちゃん、バンビって呼ばれてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/02/20/7228195/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クッキングー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トングで挟んでみたの巻。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな、ななみまりか ハッピーバースデー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二十歳とセブンティーン(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハ終わりにサプライズバースデーをしました！\n二人とも良い笑顔だった(〃▽〃)\n素敵な一年を過ごしてね♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/02/20/7228195/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は収録があり、最終リハです。\nデビュー一周年、素敵な幕開けにするぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/02/20/7228195/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短いけど、\nおやすみなさいッ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":